          <Necklace>
            <Name>Stolen Necklace (Level 14)</Name>
            <Icon>Necklace_17b</Icon>
            <Description>Lost to a pocket, away from it's locket, the gem was precious indeed.
Once fit for a king, of whom bards did sing, the necklace is now in need.</Description>
            <DropLocation>Friends in Low Places, end chest (Heroic Normal); Shadow Over Wheloon, quest chain end reward (Heroic)</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>14</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Necklace/>
